  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlot the ordered pairs in the relation on your calculator. Choose a suitable viewing window.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"295\" height\u003d\"57\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_1a_90/image001.gif\" class\u003d\"text-top\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
